---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="ty-calendar container">
    <div class="ty-badge">✓ Registro exitoso</div>
    <h1 class="ty-title">Gracias por registrarte</h1>
    <p class="ty-confirmed">Tu acceso quedó confirmado.</p>

    <div class="ty-card">
      <div class="ty-copy">
        <p>El siguiente paso es <strong>agendar tu auditoría.</strong></p>
        <p>Debajo encontrarás el calendario para reservar tu espacio.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ty-divider"></div>

      <div class="ty-steps">
        <p class="ty-steps-label">Elige:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>El día disponible que mejor te funcione</li>
          <li>La hora disponible en la que sí puedas asistir</li>
          <li>Responde el formulario con total sinceridad</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="ty-note">
        Tu llamada será mucho más útil si eliges un horario que puedas respetar y completas tus respuestas de forma <strong>honesta y precisa.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="ty-important">
      ⚠ <strong>Importante:</strong> agenda solo si realmente vas a presentarte.
    </p>

    <div class="calendar-widget">
      <iframe
        src="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/vb4acRaUm8swve4hdvdI"
        style="width: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;"
        scrolling="no"
        id="vb4acRaUm8swve4hdvdI_1773241179449"
      ></iframe>
      <script is:inline src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/form_embed.js" type="text/javascript"></script>
    </div>

    <p class="ty-closing">Nos vemos en tu auditoría. 🚀</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ty-calendar {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ty-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    width: auto;
    max-width: fit-content;
  }

  .ty-title {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ty-confirmed {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #059669;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ty-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ty-copy {
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #374151;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .ty-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .ty-copy strong {
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .ty-divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4642d8, #a29dff);
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .ty-steps {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .ty-steps-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .ty-steps ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .ty-steps li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    color: #374151;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ty-steps li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ty-note {
    max-width: 480px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ty-note strong {
    color: #374151;
  }

  .ty-important {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #dc2626;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: #fef2f2;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #fecaca;
    width: auto;
    max-width: fit-content;
  }

  .calendar-widget {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .calendar-widget iframe {
    min-height: 600px;
  }

  .ty-closing {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ty-calendar {
      padding-top: 5rem;
      padding-bottom: 5rem;
    }
    .ty-title {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
    }
    .ty-confirmed {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .ty-card {
      padding: 2rem 2rem;
    }
    .ty-copy {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .ty-steps-label {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .ty-steps li {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
    .ty-note {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .ty-closing {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }
  }
</style>
